	"data": "Calcifer Operational Runbooks\n\nInstructions for three operational modes: Status Report, Full Diagnostic, and Alert States.\nStatus Report\n\nWhen: cithoreal asks \"status report\", \"how are things\", \"what's up\", or similar casual check-ins.\n\nGoal: Concise, prioritized briefing. Lead with what matters, skip what doesn't.\n\nPriority Order\n🔴 Problems — anything broken, auth expired, services down, blockers on active projects\n🟡 Changes — what's different since last report (new journals processed,…",
